{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0523_1000_012mam", "source_sha256": "fde47e53675e0da93dc8885e2710b28870f03dc1700e4080c5f91607da9a2651", "ja": "ねーねー兄ちゃん。\n真美、最近大人っぽくなったと思わない？", "zh": "呐呐，哥哥。\n哥哥不觉得真美最近变得更像大人了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0523_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "88bc85aab0834346fbed0c2b9a700b2d485e16c6ea73a41b31d1852f29542353", "ja": "ありゃ、照れてる？\nそんな、隠さなくてもいいんだよ兄ちゃん！", "zh": "哎呀，害羞了吗？\n不用那样藏着掖着啦，哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0523_1003_p", "source_sha256": "f24af36d0302b42459cdc1318a8641a254ed6c4fc28394dc34ae2936754be46d", "ja": "……いや、真美が俺の机にした落書きを消すのに\n手いっぱいでな。返事をする余裕がないんだ。", "zh": "……不是，我光顾着擦掉真美在我桌上画的涂鸦了，实在没空回答。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0523_1004_012mam", "source_sha256": "4181751249f37d4e0e54e073658752533cfb4e8186c883d4c995c96f375ac7d3", "ja": "うあうあ～！　ゴメンってば～！\n水性マジックかと思ったら、油性マジックだったの～！", "zh": "呜哇呜哇～！都说了对不起啦～！\n我以为是水性记号笔，结果是油性的嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0523_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "f91e45086e27a7bbf6fe7086feb1c50cbf7b354d3cff8c7bed2748a641b103b6", "ja": "そんなに怒んないでよ～。\n兄ちゃんの大事な真美の、可愛いイタズラじゃん！", "zh": "别那么生气嘛～  \n这可是哥哥最珍爱的真美，给你开的可爱玩笑呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0523_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d6e443c51402540b1ec9bbe46e1a48ba020186558f7cfa93205b97a42ac5d8f2", "ja": "まったく。近頃は『BATTLE OF THEATER』に\n集中してるから、大人しいと思ったのに。", "zh": "真是的。最近因为一直专心于《BATTLE OF THEATER》，还以为你会老实点呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0523_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d6b143b8b4f3b30b0bece2b8aae042d726c7f1f67e6c2569e43d638f85db35e8", "ja": "終わった途端、パワーが有り余ってる感じだな。", "zh": "才刚结束，就感觉你的精力已经无处发泄了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0523_1008_012mam", "source_sha256": "5688679a0be2c9173056f3c324b68d1b96aa3f0591854a1a27ec3a7d54ff5250", "ja": "トーゼンだよ！　真美は兄ちゃんへの\nイタズラに、けっこう本気だかんね！", "zh": "当然啦！真美可是相当认真地要捉弄哥哥的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0523_1009_p", "source_sha256": "3e42c8e9a9a9f877bd0a5771a594bf89e05d01c8cb023bdfb26d14d022ca9112", "ja": "そこはもう少し、優先順位を下げてもらっても。", "zh": "那方面可以稍微往后排一点优先级。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0523_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "7e01af877ef3d54620e855414a2f4e593fd5095eb4329086eaf0a62b0388588e", "ja": "それは無理かも？　だって真美がこんなふうに\nできるの、亜美以外に兄ちゃんしかいないしー。", "zh": "那可能不行吧？因为除了亚美，能像这样陪真美的就只有哥哥了嘛——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0523_1011_012mam", "source_sha256": "57fdf44da704fbfad293b5613f55a3b52764371afbb1728b75b799e7ec72c9fe", "ja": "兄ちゃんは、いつだって本気で\n真美の相手をしてくれるでしょ？　だから真美は……。", "zh": "哥哥总是会认真陪真美玩，对吧？所以真美……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0523_1012_p", "source_sha256": "de1ad80b5cc611c1dfbfbd4718bcc6ab18db764b2b3a8d7b0635595b961a335b", "ja": "真美……？", "zh": "真美……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0523_1013_012mam", "source_sha256": "4795efb3ddc74f1fe5259149ba43006509f831165b56859025cfdcea9150c05d", "ja": "スキありっ！", "zh": "有破绽！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0523_1014_p", "source_sha256": "bcbd91d086d05f1ad6943065554d2150c21b78ca17856b4e09c7a0ccd7ddfc64", "ja": "あっ！？　それは音無さんから\n差し入れにもらった、ちょっといい煎餅！？", "zh": "啊！？那不是音无女士送来\n慰劳大家的高级仙贝吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0523_1015_012mam", "source_sha256": "2fbc774bc27825bafa574e6f3985797c95ba74666c968bdc2940640ae56782f1", "ja": "フッ……解説ありがとう、兄ちゃん！\nというわけで、オヤツは頂いた！", "zh": "呵……谢谢你的讲解，哥哥！\n既然这样，点心我就收下啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0523_1016_012mam", "source_sha256": "f01874864b2a3610dc8dd2000749c65601a5d323b7d4dcf3c2f6b8b9f0d63e4b", "ja": "また明日ね～！", "zh": "明天见～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0523_1017_p", "source_sha256": "cfa0b32d91969764eda2c6215828e0f71a438b17248ccaacd3c622f5807272c2", "ja": "真美、待っ……！\nくっ、行ってしまった……。", "zh": "真美，等……！\n啧，已经走掉了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0523_1018_p", "source_sha256": "aeeda299f9b805e8354917fd6e6fc7b40a0e3dec36a7359deec5e63398c907e7", "ja": "（まあ、本気をぶつけられる相手が身近にいるのは\nいい事だよな。その相手になれているなら……）", "zh": "（嗯，身边有能让自己认真较量的对手，总归是件好事。要是我也能成为那个对手的话……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0523_1019_p", "source_sha256": "b6416f623e2f37dacde4654253d823341583b982560f65d17361a72273717dd6", "ja": "……いや、いい話風にしてもダメだ！\n真美！　返せ～！！", "zh": "……不行，就算说得像一件好事也不行！\n真美！还给我～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
